Year = {2025},
Volume = {16},
Pages = {1-20},
Abstract = {Environmental Education plays a crucial role in raising awareness and
   changing behavior in relation to the environment. However, its
   effectiveness is often hampered by challenges such as the lack of
   institutionalization of environmental issues in school curricula, the
   limitation of teachers in addressing environmental issues and the lack
   of adequate teaching material. to Environmental Education (EE) of high
   school teachers from the state education network in the city
   ofJuazeiro-Bahia. For this, a questionnaire with semi-structured
   questions was applied to six schools. Note the need for adequate
   training so that environmental issues, as a dimension of the
   educational-school process, are understood as a socio-environmental
   problem.},
